  "Software Details": "Szczegóły oprogramowania",
  "Personalize Your Theme Color With the Theme Customizer module of eCommerceGo, you have full control over your stores appearance. Start by selecting a theme color that aligns with your brand identity. Whether you prefer bold and vibrant hues or subtle and calming shades, this feature allows you to choose from a wide range of colors to make your store visually appealing and unique. By customizing your theme color, you create a consistent and recognizable brand experience for your customers, enhancing their engagement and loyalty.": "Spersonalizuj kolor swojego motywu Dzięki modułowi dostosowywania motywu w eCommerceGo masz pełną kontrolę nad wyglądem swoich sklepów. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Zobacz demonstrację na żywo",
  "Define Your Border Color": "Zdefiniuj kolor obramowania",
  "Borders play a crucial role in defining the structure and aesthetics of your stores design. The Theme Customizer module enables you to easily customize border colors to match your chosen theme and enhance the visual hierarchy of your content. This feature allows you to make specific elements stand out or blend seamlessly with the overall design, providing a polished and professional look to your store.": "Granice odgrywają kluczową rolę w definiowaniu struktury i estetyki projektu sklepów. ",
  "Choose Your Theme White Color": "Wybierz swój motyw w kolorze białym",
  "For those who prefer a clean and minimalist aesthetic, the Theme Customizer module offers the option to adjust the white color used throughout your theme. This feature allows you to select the perfect shade of white that complements your store’s design, ensuring that your content is clear, readable, and visually appealing. A well-chosen white theme color can give your store a fresh, modern look that appeals to a wide audience.": "Dla tych, którzy preferują czystą i minimalistyczną estetykę, moduł Theme Customizer oferuje opcję dostosowania białego koloru używanego w całym motywie. ",
  "Customize Your Button Color": "Dostosuj kolor przycisku",
  "Buttons are critical for guiding users through your store, and their color plays a significant role in user experience. With the Theme Customizer module, you can easily change the button colors to ensure they stand out and encourage clicks. Choose colors that complement your theme or make bold choices to draw attention to key actions, such as adding items to a cart or completing a purchase. Customizing button colors helps improve navigation and enhances the overall functionality of your store, making it more user-friendly and visually cohesive.": "Przyciski odgrywają kluczową rolę w prowadzeniu użytkowników po sklepie, a ich kolor odgrywa znaczącą rolę w doświadczeniu użytkownika. ",
  "Opt for a Theme Black Color": "Wybierz motyw czarny kolor",
